# Test Server Deploy

When the user asks to deploy/sync/push to the test environment (测试环境, 测试服务器, 31, debug, stable):

1. Read and follow `.agents/skills/deploy-test-server/SKILL.md`
2. **Always** run `.\scripts\sync-to-test-server.ps1` — never hand-roll scp/ssh
3. Default target is **debug**; stable only when explicitly requested
4. Debug: **incremental** (default) uploads changed files to the mount; **--full** refreshes from Docker image
5. Frontend: **local** `npm run build` → zip `web/dist` → upload → extract. Never `docker exec ... npm run build`. Use `--build-web` for frontend-only.
6. Report upload count and restart/build output to the user
